        "1041",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78648bcfe4f66d42878429f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bec634000510a468bf0c203a32955f8df432a6fc63b80c98ff19fcd03a69f626",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96c90fb7d086a23c0e2fa90a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爆进爆进──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a480cc003d1efda22882d73a0bbeaaabbdc0d14021dbaa5738e2d16879cb1ccf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7def0b6e6e3c6bce6725082c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哇！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a0d791ab74893afe99a1e02928b4e17aa608e8354452fd1c3d47bd776bfcf8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83b8e02f36574ce191d6d808",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d264d03e7d8e5c9efe5b7f7e0b00b44c8c02904342dffc94475681ccb9893872",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:369d55edd3c1e50de3b7beb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e500ea91ca206dbf021eb089043789a3678d005f56ca2e6ae650471dfddce20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42807fb9b1329d7d0d5a882d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊呜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec9510babac054e7c407ef5aa0246c43f620214eff20c52274a9a071ec721a62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85bc2e185f959f5fa0262a52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "df7d1e97042f6e694e9d045e354f733c9f1d97c54ec0a7c3f42f1552f0046e85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e78e1a09dcaa15c68ad8309",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦！明天可以拿到这个啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5d26451cab6df5076d9a072cbdbc37b435a7e42eebf64023b7806ff64e68d89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d0ecabb8c6af6ea306d5bb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算能量快要耗尽……\r\n我也要坚强地……以楷模的姿态……\r\n继续奔跑……哦……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a516b3210d89230eac691f374cfa9b2adba9f1b8eeaaadaf78088e1ba9f6145a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7272d1d3ff6e179ac0fc6b9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔、唔唔唔……\r\n动起来啊，我的脚～！！\r\n为什么会变得这么沉重～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdadfd61ff6e0c43a3726a3f11c533109b3b32a54e3f12fae32c01eec7e91bcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d04facffea1be2fce54d38e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身为所有学生的楷模！\r\n让大家见识一下我训练时\r\n优秀的模样！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ef9c36bc5918240bd22241a227e4b368925591362afde5e75c208b1ae2ff0d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fd73fbdf5f60de4a118fb5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好期待我的大爆进吧！\r\n今天的我一定会很出色的哦哦哦！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "955d396fadf2ea1a6465a5b0c4ffef28841748b36d2673b6b94225d6afdaf939",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afe33e5639b1cf36e6cec76c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是什么样的训练，\r\n我进王一定都能完成给您看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73b3551cde33e014fb5400ace330730830924b8583d1892026469660f81e7079",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:818b1fe4d8063dca044e5994",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "热身运动都已经做好了！\r\n来吧，我们要开始什么样的\r\n训练呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "771c96c933cf7af083892fa06b8284c0cc6c2ac44666554fc9be4c719615d9ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8695cf4240f2fd8917252a1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要从什么开始做起呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4aba11e3b5abce7f83637d6891925563b9d760867ce096bb0ce4268b865c9ff8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d743b3475a7adae271624ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练的时间到了呢！\r\n我明白了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22a0e0d6fdda895aa086d6a9e6ebafe69a98be7452925aadf8a1be5bd8f96d4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a76878245f252e4f779efc3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔唔唔……！！\r\n专心、专心～……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb0922a128130eb2ed5f61eea3f8895ab23c5909f7cf659c961b34b6d07f3498",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86af02a031a83e82e891699b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……今天的天空也很漂亮呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "501a27127c62f92dbbe9a8e4eed456cba4fbac0501162e9888dc7f8e2dd55bc7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91d86c0f677db24827a691c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔～身为班长的我～\r\n我身为班长～\r\n我明明知道该做些什么的，可是～……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e49fdce1367d5628148a423f8edcaabb8927c04b2bac7dff4d97927fb9e13203",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f0aeebea90c45c6cabc74d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……卡关了……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "68e59d6fa53c990f9a1226ee5764b9741f3e2f340b1ba80056d3ae1f3582691e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd444341bfcc15d69a80a0c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是要参赛吧？\r\n……没问题的！就算脚没有力气……\r\n我还是能跑的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29b04e238f3fe71a1e4580cb20ab1e74805fc3135571b4048a53e1b0211d4e5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b035abe1d34f7e057d450a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……训练……员……\r\n我们又要参赛了吗……？\r\n我也是需要休息的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a45a6bd7b32157bb661022157cdb1baabd18c6d1e1768afdaf13f849bdee792",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cac8120144fe3ee6b6c795cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我感觉到了！\r\n大家想要呼喊班长的炽热的视线！\r\n我一定不会辜负大家的期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc53877c18b779e504323fce679e5b13e740cdc2877996738615aef15ecbe14c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57d7abbf19ecd4d5e736d624",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论对手是谁，都只需要专心爆进！\r\n别看我这样，我可是充满自信的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5548ba8007f5e3154e65e2222079bcff2ffda0c97cda6813f37166008a7c8ad4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2aaeb4c02efccd2fbae7730e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了迎接比赛，我已经把状态\r\n调整到最好！现在的我是最强的！\r\n说是已经赢了也不为过！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2008dcaebec115eeca8e27f9bc4cc3cf37616449069e72226d1a2f0789433bb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43a54bc8d7d9b4c7917c61a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一跑入魂！\r\n无论是什么样的比赛\r\n我都不会松懈的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1d8e72e1821c27064c224e537516b0546be41cd9ffd83a7dcbaf078ba63281c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:699a89a20bc1293db96a2860",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的我比谁都快！\r\n也就是跟平常一样的状态！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c40a42a7a86bb5ab2cd32b4eb38d54697e255a0b151c02de9efeab4f160c5db5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0ea3dde6070d1d928026b3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正确的呼吸节奏跟正确的状态！\r\n由我来取胜当然也是正确的结果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98ec90f31d302d226bde64d53faeed7ba0d2717cb1d5f66f0fe765aa0f144f21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9258ca35583ec2671b71b35e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比速度我是不会输的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a1af33a61f951a78fab08d6c37a02adcbd8852e5c40bf0df58f65cf620babd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed881b4abe63ff56e6ed1871",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是，我向你保证一定会赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2371d0cd7106b2a65d1ed157b5766ac9b6e100a3956780f469fd52a5c208e9b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9884e0a08c140ae928e73fd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可以跑步了吗？\r\n可以了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14190dcdab0ef0194f569afbb7a40269bb5b474675024f595436f776fd5bb1c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01661fad933aa07a9f166b38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔唔……感觉脚有点在发抖。\r\n原来这就是大家口中所说的紧张感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c0bc54dc5c0a838efb421579af01ca322678939775d04c76c128ee5651b46e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60e70d8127b9ac83358a4320",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我决定要什么都不想，\r\n专心爆进！没问题，\r\n我一定会赢的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff0a1cdf070b47309c22ad4b33db1b63e575ed30ba963bbee1e1e154c418b4e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82f11a05fabb8153849e044b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有必要感到不安。\r\n我会帮你把所有烦恼都吹散的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4889656592da2f99856ecab023d1cc2fc29527dc91fec211b6a8c0f937bc636f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1041",
        "20034"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
